.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-enable\-irq
enable the IRQ plugin (same as \fB\-\-enable\-plugin irq\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-disable\-bold
