.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-disable\-bg
disable background colors in the curses interface (config fallback:
\fB[outputs] disable_bg\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-disable\-separator
disable the separator lines in the curses interface (config fallback:
\fB[outputs] separator\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-disable\-unicode
